//! The `view-timeline` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS)
//! [shorthand](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Guides/Cascade/Shorthand_properties)
//! property defines a [named view progress
//! timeline's](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Guides/Scroll-driven_animations/Timelines#named_view_progress_timeline)
//! name, direction, and inset values.
//!
//! Initial: view-timeline-name: none; view-timeline-axis: block. Inherited: no.
//! Percentages: not accepted.
//!
//! Keyword effects:
//! - none: Indicates that the timeline has no name. This is the default value. See
//! https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS/Reference/Properties/view-timeline-name
//!
//! Grammar: [ <'view-timeline-name'> [ <'view-timeline-axis'> || <'view-timeline-inset'> ]? ]#
//!
//! Specification: https://drafts.csswg.org/scroll-animations-1/#propdef-view-timeline
